Date: Sun, 1 Mar 2026 09:21:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 192/244] Ensure messages are consistently routed to the
 correct chat sessions

Update session tracking logic to capture activity from both user and assistant messages, ensuring that `lastUserSessionKey` is reliably set and subsequent responses are routed to the correct session. Also updates script versions in control UI HTML files.

